{
  "cells": [
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## 📊 NLP Methods: Extracting Insights from Job Descriptions\n",
        "\n",
        "### 1. Irrelevant or Redundant Columns\n",
        "To prepare the dataset, we removed several unnecessary columns:\n",
        "- **Unique identifiers** like `ID`\n",
        "- **URLs** and tracking fields\n",
        "- **Timestamps** such as `LAST_UPDATED_TIMESTAMP`\n",
        "- **Detailed NAICS/SOC codes** (multiple levels)\n",
        "\n",
        "These fields either added redundancy, complexity, or had no meaningful impact on text-based analysis. Removing them simplifies the data and avoids clutter.\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "### 2. Why Remove Multiple Versions of NAICS/SOC Codes?\n",
        "Different versions of NAICS/SOC codes can lead to inconsistent classification. Removing them ensures:\n",
        "- Better **comparability**\n",
        "- **Standardized categories**\n",
        "- Fewer **classification mismatches** across industries\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "### 3. Analytical Improvements\n",
        "By removing redundant fields and harmonizing the structure:\n",
        "- We reduce noise in modeling\n",
        "- Improve accuracy of classification\n",
        "- Enable more reliable and meaningful text analysis\n",
        "\n",
        "This streamlining helps focus our NLP work on relevant information.\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "### 4. Handling Missing Values\n",
        "#### Strategy:\n",
        "1. **Drop rows or columns** with excessive missing values.\n",
        "2. **Fill missing values** using:\n",
        "   - Median for **numerical** columns\n",
        "   - \"Unknown\" for **categorical** columns\n"
      ],
      "id": "9a12e21c"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "# Visualize missing values\n",
        "msno.heatmap(lightcast_data)\n",
        "plt.title(\"Missing Values Heatmap\")\n",
        "plt.show()\n",
        "\n",
        "# Fill missing values\n",
        "for col in missing_columns.index:\n",
        "    if col in numerical_columns:\n",
        "        lightcast_data[col].fillna(lightcast_data[col].median(), inplace=True)\n",
        "    elif col in categorical_columns:\n",
        "        lightcast_data[col].fillna(\"Unknown\", inplace=True)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Drop columns with >50% missing\n",
        "lightcast_data.dropna(thresh=len(lightcast_data) * 0.5, axis=1, inplace=True)"
      ],
      "id": "b48ed6cb",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "### 5. NLP Skill Extraction from Job Descriptions\n",
        "Using a list of predefined skills (e.g., Python, SQL, AI), we parsed job descriptions to extract mentions.\n"
      ],
      "id": "6bb6b05b"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "df = pd.DataFrame(lightcast_data)\n",
        "\n",
        "from collections import Counter\n",
        "import re  # Also required if you're using re.findall\n",
        "skills_keywords = [\n",
        "    \"Python\", \"SQL\", \"Machine Learning\", \"Deep Learning\", \"AI\", \"TensorFlow\", \"PyTorch\", \n",
        "    \"Excel\", \"Tableau\", \"Power BI\", \"NLP\", \"Big Data\", \"Hadoop\", \"R\", \"Java\", \"C++\"\n",
        "]\n",
        "\n",
        "# Extract and count keyword mentions in job descriptions\n",
        "skill_counts = Counter()\n",
        "for desc in df[\"BODY\"].dropna():\n",
        "    words = re.findall(r'\\\\b\\\\w+\\\\b', desc)\n",
        "    matched_skills = [word for word in words if word in skills_keywords]\n",
        "    skill_counts.update(matched_skills)\n",
        "\n",
        "skills_df = pd.DataFrame(skill_counts.items(), columns=[\"Skill\", \"Count\"]).sort_values(by=\"Count\", ascending=False)"
      ],
      "id": "9ec817a4",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "**Top skills found:** SQL, AI, Excel, Python, Tableau, and R.\n",
        "\n",
        "These skills represent a strong demand for analytical, automation, and visualization expertise.\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "### 6. Geographic Trends in AI Job Titles\n",
        "By scanning job titles for AI-related roles, we created a choropleth map showing AI job distribution across U.S. states.\n"
      ],
      "id": "f157a594"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "fig2 = px.choropleth(\n",
        "    state_job_counts,\n",
        "    locations=\"STATE_ABBR\",\n",
        "    locationmode=\"USA-states\",\n",
        "    color=\"AI_JOB_COUNT\",\n",
        "    hover_name=\"STATE_NAME\",\n",
        "    color_continuous_scale=\"Blues\",\n",
        "    title=\"AI Job Market Trends Across US States\",\n",
        "    scope=\"usa\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "fig2.show()"
      ],
      "id": "cb021f52",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "**Result**: California, Texas, and New York dominate AI hiring, aligned with key tech hubs.\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "### 7. AI Growth vs Displacement by Industry\n",
        "We simulated industry-level impact of AI, highlighting:\n",
        "- Growth in **Finance, IT, Healthcare**\n",
        "- Displacement in **Retail and Manufacturing**\n"
      ],
      "id": "89304bb8"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "fig3 = go.Figure()\n",
        "fig3.add_trace(go.Bar(x=filtered_data[\"NAICS2_NAME\"], y=filtered_data[\"AI_Growth\"], name=\"AI-Driven Growth\", marker_color=\"purple\"))\n",
        "fig3.add_trace(go.Bar(x=filtered_data[\"NAICS2_NAME\"], y=filtered_data[\"AI_Displacement\"], name=\"AI Displacement\", marker_color=\"gray\"))\n",
        "fig3.update_layout(title=\"AI Impact on Jobs by Industry\", barmode=\"stack\")\n",
        "fig3.show()"
      ],
      "id": "5251ec85",
